      "reason": "Compare complete tag names. The scanner stored each name code point as one byte, so an end tag whose name shares the low byte of every start-tag code point (for example U+AD41 against U+AC41, or ASCII A against U+AC41) closed the element without an error; UTF-8 bytes keep such names distinct, and identical names, including all-ASCII ones, compare as before.",
